BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 130.45 Tm (The back end is a claims-defense machine. Arif relays the ClaimDOC CEO's estimate that the clinical team) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 115.22 Tm (of nurses and coding experts scrapes 25 to 30 percent of the dollars off any inpatient stay before repricing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 100.00 Tm (even starts [A__ZFq9k8Ds @ 00:33:00]. The marquee catch is ICU unbundling: Arif cites Stanford billing up) Tj ET
