0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Health plans are the new fiduciary battlefield, and the people who litigate and defend these cases agree on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (why. At Seyfarth Shaw, Sam frames the shift bluntly. 401\(k\) and 403\(b\) fee suits are roughly 20 years old) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (and that market is saturated. The plaintiffs' bar is now turning to group health plans, armed with data that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (CAA 2020 disclosures push into the open, and plan sponsors themselves have started suing their own TPAs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm ([EwDJFTGZkoE @ 00:04:12]. Frier Levitt's panel calls the Johnson & Johnson complaint the first case of its) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (kind: employees suing their own employer over PBM mismanagement. The panel draws a straight line back) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (to the retirement-plan fiduciary suits that came before it [jpLEKhmPpLs @ 00:03:09]. Justin Burgess opens) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (his compliance briefing on the same note. Group health plan litigation is spiking, he says, and fiduciaries) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (have to monitor fees, PBM fees above all, exactly the issue in the J&J suit [Bq89alxy8qQ @ 00:00:01]. Eric) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (Dailey of Multnomah Group supplies the procedural accelerant. ERISA class filing rates are high, and after) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (Northwestern the burden in these fights lies with the defense [_QhwEj0_Hrg @ 00:00:01]. Every camp reads) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (it the same way. The retirement-plan playbook already exists, the disclosure data now exists, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (self-funded health plans with large drug spend sit directly in its path.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (The legal spine of these claims is equally settled across the speakers. Ben at Seyfarth Shaw anchors health) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (plan exposure in two ERISA duties, exclusive benefit and prudence. Prudence is measured against the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (prudent-expert rule, not against what a well-meaning amateur running HR might have done [EwDJFTGZkoE) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (@ 00:19:25]. Frier Levitt's panel compresses the same idea into loyalty and prudence. It points operators to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (paragraph 7 of the roughly 80-page J&J complaint, where the core allegations are concentrated, and treats) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (that paragraph as the map for what plaintiffs will copy next [jpLEKhmPpLs @ 00:05:01]. Mike Hill of Total) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (Control Health Plans settles the scope question. Self-funded medical, dental and vision plans are ERISA) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (plans. The J&J class action names both the company and its benefits committee over the PBM and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (consultant, not just the vendor [FvXAV4cqPRg @ 00:00:24]. John Barl, on The Alliance webinar, ties the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (duty to cash: fees must be disclosed, and Johnson & Johnson and Wells Fargo have both been sued over) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (health plan fees [2VQyGj0Z_oY @ 00:24:14]. Taken together, these four speakers treat a self-funded) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (sponsor as a fiduciary over every dollar routed to TPAs, PBMs, brokers and consultants. A plaintiff will ask) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (two questions about that money: did it serve participants, and would a prudent expert have paid it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (The baseline prerequisites are a written paper trail and a funded backstop. Justin Burgess lays out the floor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.92 Tm (Form a committee, train it, document how vendors were selected, watch for hidden fees, and bring in ERISA) Tj ET
