BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 509.77 Tm (The money trap practitioners keep hitting is the relabeled generic. Mike Hill walks the teriflunomide line from) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 494.55 Tm (the J&J complaint: pharmacies acquire it at 91 cents per 14-milligram tablet, so a 90-day supply costs $81,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 479.32 Tm (yet the plan paid $10,239 for the same prescription, a 12,403% markup [FvXAV4cqPRg @ 00:02:29]. Frier) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 464.10 Tm (Levitt explains the mechanism behind numbers like that: generics get relabeled as specialty, reimbursed at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 448.87 Tm (AWP minus 12% instead of AWP minus 87%, which works out to $1 to $3 a pill, and exclusivity is steered to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 433.65 Tm (PBM-owned specialty pharmacies [jpLEKhmPpLs @ 00:09:14]. Pramod John, Vivio's CEO, prices the same) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 418.42 Tm (drug at Cost Plus at $28.40 against roughly $10,000 under the plan, about 300 times the transparent price) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 403.20 Tm ([jpLEKhmPpLs @ 00:24:16]. Getting out late is expensive too, because plans that carve out specialty pay) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 387.97 Tm (seven-figure penalties [jpLEKhmPpLs @ 00:38:45]. The economics check is blunt and lives in the contract. If) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 372.75 Tm (the contract lets the PBM define what counts as a 'generic specialty' drug and route it to its own pharmacy,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 357.52 Tm (the overcharge hides inside a definition rather than inside the headline discount guarantee, and every) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 342.30 Tm (renewal signed without fixing that definition stacks another year into the six-year lookback window plaintiffs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 327.07 Tm (use.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 311.85 Tm (John Barl's contract traps at The Alliance are the most operational warnings any self-funded sponsor will) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 296.62 Tm (hear. A handshake deal kills the exemption: without a written contract there is no ERISA 408\(b\)\(2\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 281.40 Tm (protection, and prohibited transactions can carry a penalty of about 100% of the amount at issue) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 266.17 Tm ([2VQyGj0Z_oY @ 00:23:16]. Leverage evaporates the moment a vendor knows it won the RFP, so limitation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 250.95 Tm (of liability, indemnification and data access have to sit in the RFP before anyone responds; typical vendor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 235.72 Tm (caps run $50,000 per error, $1 million per claim, or four times the last 12 months of fees [2VQyGj0Z_oY @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 220.50 Tm (00:40:26]. Lock-ins are the next trap: one year is acceptable with 60 to 90 days of termination for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 205.27 Tm (convenience after that, five years is risky and ten is, in Barl's words, kind of too long. The January CAA FAQ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 190.05 Tm (made sponsors responsible for gag clauses in downstream contracts they never see, which Barl calls a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 174.82 Tm (really bad result from an employer perspective [2VQyGj0Z_oY @ 00:51:20]. Frier Levitt shows why the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 159.60 Tm (data-access term is not optional: PBMs refuse to give plans their own data, and Vivio was named in the J&J) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 144.37 Tm (complaint without ever being contacted [jpLEKhmPpLs @ 00:47:45].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 129.15 Tm (The administrative failures are quieter but just as expensive. In the Goodyear case, the Quit for Life program) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 113.92 Tm (offered retroactive reimbursement, but the flyers omitted it, and the complaint alleges more than $17 million) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 98.70 Tm (in surcharges collected from 2020 to 2025 [NtoIMU293PI @ 00:02:54]. Goodyear did win part of the fight,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 83.47 Tm (since collecting the surcharge was held a settlor function and plaintiffs alleged no plan loss, but the claims) Tj ET
